{"repositoryId":1071272475,"availability":"available","full":"alpic-ai/skybridge","name":"skybridge","description":"Skybridge is a full-stack TypeScript framework for MCP Apps and ChatGPT Apps. Type-safe. React-powered. Platform-agnostic.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":2165,"forks":142,"created":"2025-10-07T05:53:48Z","updated":"2026-10-19T14:27:07Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://skybridge.tech","topics":["agent","ai","apps-sdk","chatgpt","claude","claude-code","devtools","ext-apps","llms","mcp","mcp-apps","mcp-server","mcp-ui","modelcontextprotocol","openai","react","skills","tooling","typescript"],"demo":"https://everything.skybridge.tech/try","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T15:55:39.633Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T15:55:39.633Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T15:55:39.633Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T17:01:13.170Z","stars":2160,"forks":141},{"at":"2026-10-19T15:55:39.633Z","stars":2165,"forks":142}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The full-stack React framework for MCP Apps and MCP Servers.","Skybridge helps developers build type-safe MCP Apps for Claude, ChatGPT and other UI-enabled MCP clients, with a complete set of tooling designed for both humans and agents.","Why? MCP Apps extend the Model Context Protocol with rich, interactive UI views rendered from MCP servers. Conversational apps need seamless interaction between the user, the UI, and the model. This means new UX patterns, developer tooling, and abstractions. Plus, the raw SDKs are low-level: no hooks, type safety, HMR, etc."],"features":["Delightful dev environment: Skybridge provides a dev server with a local emulator, hot module reload, and a permanent tunnel to connect your local app to Claude and ChatGPT.","Write once, run everywhere: the framework abstracts implementation differences between MCP clients, so your app runs seamlessly in Claude, ChatGPT, VSCode, and any other MCP Apps compatible client.","Agent-ready: powerful skills, CLI, and programmatic dev tool APIs, everything your coding agent needs to build MCP Apps end-to-end.","Type-safe end-to-end: tRPC-style inference from MCP server tool definition to React view for type safety from server to frontend.","React-first: Intuitive React Query-style hooks, with advanced state management."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alpic-ai/skybridge/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ff7d227852dabeed189be25223921856bab1c5aab0af29e0ffb88f4dd0c50eba","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T17:01:13.275Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T17:01:13.275Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"The full-stack React framework for MCP Apps and MCP Servers.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alpic-ai/skybridge/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Skybridge helps developers build type-safe MCP Apps for Claude, ChatGPT and other UI-enabled MCP clients, with a complete set of tooling designed for both humans and agents.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alpic-ai/skybridge/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"You can also self-host on any Node.js-compatible platform.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alpic-ai/skybridge/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"ff7d227852dabeed189be25223921856bab1c5aab0af29e0ffb88f4dd0c50eba","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alpic-ai/skybridge/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T17:01:13.275Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-15T12:11:21Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alpic-ai/skybridge/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T23:51:15.553Z","hash":"ff7d227852dabeed189be25223921856bab1c5aab0af29e0ffb88f4dd0c50eba","originalBytes":14447,"storedBytes":14447,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T17:01:13.170Z","subjects":["MCP servers & agents"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Developer tools","subj